Article 11 (Victim status)

Once criminal proceedings are instituted for an offence considered domestic violence, under the terms of this law, the injured party automatically acquires victim status for legal purposes, namely:

• a)- access to shelter spaces:

• b)- preferential service for obtaining evidence by the competent authorities; Published in the 1st Series of the Official Gazette No. 133 of 14 July 2011 Page 4 of 9

