Article 27 (Occurrence report)

1. The complainant or denouncer is attended to, as a priority, by the competent authorities who must prepare the occurrence report, containing:

o a)- all the elements contained in the complaint or denunciation, under the terms of the previous article;

o b)- name and age of the victim, the perpetrator and dependents, if any;

• c)- brief summary of the facts and protection measures proposed by the victim.

